{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月27日，最新公佈的法律文本顯示，英國與歐盟已就重塑脱歐後的貿易關係達成新協議，旨在取消食品及飲料出口面臨的邊境檢查，並實現雙方碳排放交易市場的互聯。作為協議的一部分，英國將向歐盟繳納額外的「參與費」，同時承諾與歐盟相關法律法規保持動態一致，但不享有歐盟新規制定過程中的投票權。相關協議預計於2028年生效。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588184.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T09:43:57.700344+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:18:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:37:13.864204+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T09:37:13.864204+00:00","content_hash":"1d822f2156cc3e9b886f6fe19ac22882a0030efdb545c624a908979589874a7a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}